letion, all amounts paid, including the deposit, will be forfeited.</li><li><b>Ownership and Transfer.</b> Ownership of the item will remain with Exclusive Essence until the total price is paid in full. This Agreement is non-transferable.</li><li><b>Default.</b> If the customer fails to make a scheduled payment, Exclusive Essence reserves the right to cancel the layaway Agreement. All funds paid, including the deposit, will be forfeited.</li><li><b>Compliance with Ohio Law.</b> This Agreement is governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Ohio, including all applicable Ohio Revised Code provisions and consumer protection laws related to layaway agreements.</li><li><b>Agreement Signatures.</b> By signing this Agreement, both parties acknowledge that they have read, comprehended and consented to the terms and conditions set forth herein.</li></ol><div class="layaway-sig"><div>Customer Signature &amp; Date</div><div>Store Representative Signature &amp; Date</div></div><div class="layaway-foot-note">This contract is governed by the laws of Franklin County and the State of Ohio. To begin a layaway plan, select <b>Layaway Plan</b> at checkout or ask a team member in-store — a signed copy will be provided for your records.</div></div></div>
